config XIAOTAI_PART_CAMERA_DVP_NATIVE
    bool "Apply the reviewed DVP camera driver overlay"
    default n
    help
        The default uses the original esp32-camera public API. Select this only
        with the reviewed driver to use native nonblocking dequeue, producer
        drop counters and checked SCCB cleanup. Legacy products are unaffected.

config XIAOTAI_PART_CAMERA_DVP_BENCH_DIAG
    bool "Sample DVP inputs after missing the first frame (bench only)"
    depends on IDF_TARGET_ESP32S3 && !XIAOTAI_PART_CAMERA_DVP_NATIVE
    default n
    help
        Read GPIO and LCD_CAM state if the stock driver produces no first
        frame in 500 ms. Results count sampled transitions, not wire edges.
        No pin setup, interrupt, sensor transaction, retry, or timeout change.

config XIAOTAI_PART_CAMERA_DVP_BENCH_POWER_DWELL
    bool "Compare DVP with 100 ms PWDN hold and 50 ms settle (bench only)"
    depends on IDF_TARGET_ESP32S3 && !XIAOTAI_PART_CAMERA_DVP_NATIVE && !XIAOTAI_PART_CAMERA_DVP_BENCH_DIAG
    default n
    help
        On a camera with a power-control line, hold PWDN for at least 100 ms
        after a successful assertion and settle for 50 ms after release.
        This does not imply that power to the sensor was removed. No retry.
